"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/condemn-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-confine-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"confine","sort_order":1,"sense":"限制","alt_zh":"高中生在方框內仔細上色，框外保持乾淨。","example":"Please confine the paint to the area inside the frame.","example_zh":"請把油漆限制在框內的區域。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/confine-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-conform-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"conform","sort_order":1,"sense":"遵從","alt_zh":"一排穿相同藍色隊服的高中球員整齊站著，教練檢查裝備。","example":"The players must conform to the same uniform rules.","example_zh":"球員必須遵從相同的制服規定。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/conform-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-consensus-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"consensus","sort_order":1,"sense":"共識","alt_zh":"一群高中生圍著鳥屋模型一致點頭並豎起拇指。","example":"The group reached a consensus to build a birdhouse.","example_zh":"小組達成共識，決定製作鳥屋。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/consensus-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-consent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"consent","sort_order":1,"sense":"同意","alt_zh":"拿相機的高中女生先詢問，朋友微笑點頭並豎拇指。","example":"The student asked for her friend's consent before taking a photo.","example_zh":"這位學生拍照前，先徵求朋友的同意。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/consent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-constraint-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"constraint","sort_order":1,"sense":"限制","alt_zh":"高中生看著僅剩少量硬幣與機器人零件，商量如何完成簡單機器人。","example":"The small budget was a constraint on our robot project.","example_zh":"有限的預算限制了我們的機器人計畫。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/constraint-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-contemplate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"contemplate","sort_order":1,"sense":"沉思","alt_zh":"高中女生坐在湖邊長椅上托腮沉思，膝上放著闔起的筆記本。","example":"Nora sat by the lake to contemplate her future.","example_zh":"諾拉坐在湖邊，思考自己的未來。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/contemplate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-contempt-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"contempt","sort_order":1,"sense":"輕蔑","alt_zh":"一名高中球員對初學者的投籃練習冷笑，初學者露出受傷的表情。","example":"The player showed contempt by sneering at the beginner's effort.","example_zh":"這名球員嘲笑初學者的努力，顯露輕蔑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/contempt-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-contend-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"contend","sort_order":1,"sense":"爭奪；聲稱","alt_zh":"兩隊高中辯論選手分站講台兩側，中間展示獎盃。","example":"Two school teams will contend for the debate trophy.","example_zh":"兩支校隊將爭奪辯論賽獎盃。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/contend-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-contradict-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"contradict","sort_order":1,"sense":"矛盾","alt_zh":"高中生指著乾燥天空搖頭，朋友則指向他身旁的大水窪與滴水雨傘。","example":"The wet ground seemed to contradict his claim that it had not rained.","example_zh":"濕漉漉的地面似乎和他聲稱沒下雨的說法矛盾。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/contradict-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-corporate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"corporate