/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/delegate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-depict-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"depict","sort_order":1,"sense":"描繪","alt_zh":"高中女生在戶外畫橋，畫布上的石橋與眼前實景一致。","example":"Her painting will depict the old bridge beside our school.","example_zh":"她的畫將描繪學校旁的老橋。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/depict-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-deprive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"deprive","sort_order":1,"sense":"剝奪","alt_zh":"高牆擋住陽光，牆後的小花園陷入陰影，學生擔心地看著。","example":"The new wall would deprive the garden of sunlight.","example_zh":"新圍牆會使花園失去陽光。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/deprive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-derive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"derive","sort_order":1,"sense":"源自","alt_zh":"流動河水推動水輪，電線延伸到亮著燈的小村莊。","example":"The village derives its electricity from the river.","example_zh":"這座村莊的電力來自河流。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/derive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-designate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"designate","sort_order":1,"sense":"指定","alt_zh":"老師指向放有急救箱的桌子，安排學生志工在旁協助。","example":"The teacher will designate this table as the first-aid station.","example_zh":"老師將指定這張桌子作為急救站。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/designate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-despair-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"despair","sort_order":1,"sense":"絕望","alt_zh":"高中生低頭坐在倒塌的模型旁，朋友走近準備安慰。","example":"He felt despair when he saw his ruined science project.","example_zh":"他看到毀掉的科展作品時感到絕望。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/despair-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-diagnose-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"diagnose","sort_order":1,"sense":"診斷","alt_zh":"醫師向高中生說明顯示骨折的手臂 X 光片，學生手臂已用吊帶固定。","example":"The doctor used an X-ray to diagnose the broken arm.","example_zh":"醫師利用 X 光診斷出手臂骨折。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/diagnose-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-diplomatic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"diplomatic","sort_order":1,"sense":"外交的","alt_zh":"兩方代表在河流模型前握手，桌上放著兩面不同的純色旗。","example":"The countries reached a diplomatic agreement to share the river.","example_zh":"這些國家透過外交協商，同意共享河流。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/diplomatic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-discard-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"discard","sort_order":1,"sense":"丟棄","alt_zh":"高中生把撕破的紙板放進有回收符號的桶子。","example":"Please discard the torn cardboard in the recycling bin.","example_zh":"請把破掉的紙板丟進回收桶。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/discard-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-disclose-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"disclose","sort_order":1,"sense":"揭露","alt_zh":"科學家掀開展示罩，向驚喜的高中生展示新發現的晶體。","example":"The scientist will disclose the discovery at the school talk.","example_zh":"這位科學家將在校園講座中公開這項發現。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/disclose-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-displace-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"displace","sort_order":1,"sense":"取代","alt_zh":"新的電動幫浦正在抽水，旁邊停用的舊手壓幫浦被移開。","example":"The new machine will displace the old hand pump.","example_zh":"這台新機器將取代舊的手壓幫浦。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/displace-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dispose-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dispose","sort_order":1,"sense":"處置","alt_zh":"高中生把廢電池放入有電池圖示的專用回收箱。","example":"We dispose of used batteries at a special collection point.","example_zh":"我們把用過的電池送到專門的回收點處理。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dispose-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dispute-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dispute","sort_order":1,"sense":"爭端","alt_zh":"兩隊高中生在球場入口爭論，教練居中協調。","example":"A dispute arose over which team could use the court first.","example_zh":"兩隊為了誰能先使用球場而發生爭執。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dispute-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-disrupt-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"disrupt","sort_order":1,"sense":"擾亂","alt_zh":"倒樹擋住道路，校車停在安全距離外，學生從窗內看著。","example":"A fallen tree disrupted the school bus route.","example_zh":"一棵倒下的樹擾亂了校車行程。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/disrupt-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-dissolve-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"dissolve","sort_order":1,"sense":"溶解","alt_zh":"高中生用湯匙攪拌透明杯，倒入的糖粒正在溫水中散開。","example":"Stir the sugar until it begins to dissolve in the warm water.","example_zh":"攪拌砂糖，直到它開始溶解在溫水中。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/dissolve-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-distort-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"distort","sort_order":1,"sense":"扭曲","alt_